ArcadeScripts for s2script

Derived from ArcadeScripts-CSS 1.0.2 by Supergosciuツ:
https://github.com/supergosciu/ArcadeScripts-CSS
Reference commit: e9aa84d8876ae8f24669505cd4b03ca6d563db92

ArcadeScripts-CSS replaces the VScript logic_scripts of the jb_arcade_b6 map with
C# implementations for CounterStrikeSharp. Its scripts are themselves ports of the
map's original Squirrel VScripts.

Modified 2026-11-07: ported from C#/CounterStrikeSharp to TypeScript/s2script.
The runtime (logic_script discovery, RunScriptCode parsing and dispatch, per-round
script lifetime) and all 29 map scripts were rewritten against the s2script SDK.
Behavior differences are listed in README.md. In short: the `vscripts` keyvalue is
read through checked entity offsets; scripted damage is dealt directly with the
same attacker instead of through renamed point_hurt entities, so the custom
kill-feed icons are gone; the first-input JIT warmup is dropped; and a few upstream
defects are fixed (a shared colour table cleared for good in Colors, a sound count
shared between PlaySoundAt instances, sprite lookups that compared wrapper objects
instead of entities in LightDuel and Blob).

